    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Drihten cwæð: 'Be ðam ylcan dome, ðe ge nú mannum demað, eow byð eft gedemed'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The Lord said: “By the same judgement that you now judge a man, so you will hereafter be judged.”</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Dominus Iesus Christus dixit: 'In quo iudicio iudicaueritis, iudicabimini '</ab>
      </div>
